Figure 2: Illustrative examples of the diagnostic settings in KEEP-Bench .
Parallel evidence requires preserving evidence for two valid interpretations;
conditional evidence requires preserving an explicit condition;
and imbalanced evidence requires preserving dominant and minority evidence.

